---
const pageTitle = "what are you doing";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{pageTitle}</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: "Microsoft JhengHei", "PingFang TC", sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        
        .container {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            padding: 48px;
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .logo {
            font-size: 80px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        
        h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            color: #2d3748;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        
        .subtitle {
            color: #718096;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        
        .status {
            background: #f7fafc;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }
        
        .status-label {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #a0aec0;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        
        .status-text {
            font-size: 20px;
            color: #2d3748;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        
        .quick-links {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        
        .link-card {
            background: #f7fafc;
            border: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
        }
        
        .link-card:hover {
            border-color: #667eea;
            background: white;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.2);
        }
        
        .link-icon {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        
        .link-title {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #2d3748;
        }
        
        .notice {
            background: #fffaf0;
            border: 1px solid #fbd38d;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px;
            color: #744210;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 24px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="logo">🍅</div>
        <h1>what are you doing</h1>
        <div class="subtitle">離線優先的工時記錄工具</div>
        
        <div class="status">
            <div class="status-label">應用程式狀態</div>
            <div class="status-text">✅ 正常運行中</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="quick-links">
            <a href="/ping" class="link-card">
                <div class="link-icon">🍅</div>
                <div class="link-title">記錄工作</div>
            </a>
            
            <a href="/stats" class="link-card">
                <div class="link-icon">📊</div>
                <div class="link-title">今日統計</div>
            </a>
            
            <a href="/resolve" class="link-card">
                <div class="link-icon">⚠️</div>
                <div class="link-title">待確認時段</div>
            </a>
            
            <a href="/settings" class="link-card">
                <div class="link-icon">⚙️</div>
                <div class="link-title">設定</div>
            </a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="notice">
            ℹ️ 此應用程式通常在系統匣中執行。本頁面僅用於展示和測試。
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
